    "data": {
      "id": 2193,
      "hub_id": 2896,
      "guid": "com.noidontwanna.hephaestuspresets",
      "name": "Set of Gun Presets for Hephaestus",
      "slug": "set-of-gun-presets-for-hephaestus",
      "teaser": "Buying a finished weapon from the preset merchant and just handing it over is much more convenient.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2896.png",
      "downloads": 9975,
      "favourites_count": 11,
      "description": "<h1><strong>Set of Presets for the SPT Mod Hephaestus</strong></h1>\n<p>I don’t like the Gunsmith questline and consider it brain-dead tedium.</p>\n<p>I also don’t want to spend my time learning how to mod SPT.</p>\n<p>So buying a finished weapon from the preset merchant and just handing it over is much more convenient.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/886-hephaestus/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hephaestus</a> – Go praise the author over there — all I did was shuffle some JSONs around and turned them into presets.</li>\n<li>SPT 4</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>Just to be sure — yes, you <strong>need</strong> to install the Hephaestus mod first (link above).</p>\n<p>Then it is just simple <strong>drag and drop</strong> — like any other mod.</p>\n<p><strong>Included Presets</strong></p>\n<p>MECHANIC</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gunsmith questline – Don’t forget to fold the AKSU!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PRAPOR</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Test Drive questline – Mainly for convenience; the presets use the exact guns you receive when accepting the quest.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hell on Earth quest – Included for good measure.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Troubleshooting</strong></p>\n<p>No idea — it should work out of the box.<br />\nIf Hephaestus does not have new guns for sale, check the file paths.<br />\nFor example, if the mod folder is renamed for any reason in the future, you may need to move the files manually to their correct destination.</p>\n",
